d financial information?\",\"category\":\"account\"},{\"a\":\"We offer responsible gambling tools such as Self-Exclusion. This feature help you manage your play and take breaks when needed.\",\"q\":\"How do I set limits or self-exclude?\",\"category\":\"account\"},{\"a\":\"Use the “Forgot Password” link on the login page and follow the instructions to reset your password securely.\",\"q\":\"What should I do if I forget my password?\",\"category\":\"account\"},{\"a\":\"To comply with legal requirements, prevent underage gambling, and ensure player safety, we require photographic identification during registration and for certain transactions. \",\"q\":\"Why do you require identity verification?\",\"category\":\"account\"},{\"a\":\"No, each player is allowed only one account. Multiple accounts are not permitted and may lead to suspension or closure.\",\"q\":\"Can I have more than one account?\",\"category\":\"account\"},{\"a\":\"No, it is not possible to convert or exchange crypto or fiat currencies within Spartans.\",\"q\":\"Can I convert or change my crypto or fiat currency on Spartans?\",\"category\":\"methods\"},{\"a\":\"You can pick any available currency, and all your bets will be placed and bet amount limits will be based on that currency.\",\"q\":\"What does \\\"balance displayed in\\\" mean before entering casino games?\",\"category\":\"account\"},{\"a\":\"It shows your balances, bets, and history in your chosen currency for easy reading. Pick a new one from the “View In Currency” dropdown in settings (Profile \u003eAccount Preferences \u003e View In Currency )- no impact on your real wallet. This feature is not available for the sportsbook yet, however we are working on it.\",\"q\":\"What does “View In Currency” do and how do I change it?\",\"category\":\"account\"},{\"a\":\"Yes, there are minimum and maximum deposit and withdrawal limits, which vary depending on your chosen payment method and jurisdiction. Visit our payments page for details.\",\"q\":\"Are there limits on how much I can deposit or withdraw?\",\"category\":\"draw-deposit\"},{\"a\":\"Deposit processing times vary depending on the cryptocurrency and its blockchain network. Fiat deposit times may also vary depending on the payment method used.\",\"q\":\"What is the deposit processing time?\",\"category\":\"draw-deposit\"},{\"a\":\"Online gambling is legal in many regions but subject to local laws and licensing requirements. Our site operates only in jurisdictions where online gambling is permitted and fully regulated by the appropriate authorities.\",\"q\":\"Is online gambling legal at Spartans?\",\"category\":\"gambling\"},{\"a\":\"Free bets are subject to specific criteria, such as using the correct payment method or betting on eligible markets. Make sure you meet all the terms and conditions of the promotion.\",\"q\":\"Why didn’t I receive my free bet?\",\"category\":\"gambling\"},{\"a\":\"All games use certified random number generator"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"s (RNGs) and are regularly audited by independent agencies to ensure fairness and transparency.\",\"q\":\"How do I know the games are fair?\",\"category\":\"gambling\"},{\"a\":\"CashRake is calculated based on your total deposits. For example, if you deposit $100, you receive a CashRake limit of $33. If you make an additional $100 deposit, your CashRake limit increases accordingly, bringing your total limit to $66. The more you deposit, the higher your CashRake limit becomes.\",\"q\":\"How does CashRake work?\",\"category\":\"gambling\"},{\"a\":\"We accept crypto currencies and Fiat deposit methods. Check our cashier section for the full list and details on deposit and withdrawal processes.\",\"q\":\"What payment methods are available at Spartans?\",\"category\":\"methods\"},{\"a\":\"Our customer support team is available 24/7 via live chat or, email to assist with any questions or concerns.\",\"q\":\"How can I contact support?\",\"category\":\"support\"},{\"a\":\"If you have a 