veawayFAQ5A\":\"The number of tickets you receive depends on how much you deposit. You can check in our Terms and Conditions.\",\"giveawayFAQ5Q\":\"5. How does the ticket multiplier system work?\",\"giveawayFAQ6A\":\"The winner will be selected through a random and verifiable draw from all valid tickets. The draw date is listed on Spartans.com. The winner will be contacted within 5 business days via email or phone.\",\"giveawayFAQ6Q\":\"6. How will the winner be selected?\",\"giveawayFAQ7A\":\"If the winner cannot be contacted or does not respond within 7 days, a new winner may be selected.\",\"giveawayFAQ7Q\":\"7. What happens if the winner does not respond?\",\"giveawayFAQ8A\":\"The prize is a Mansory Koenigsegg Jesko: Spartans Edition, or a cash equivalent at Spartans.com’s discretion. All taxes, registration, delivery, and customs fees are the responsibility of the winner.\",\"giveawayFAQ8Q\":\"8. What is the prize?\",\"giveawayFAQ9A\":\"Yes. To claim the prize, the winner must be actively following all official Spartans.com social media accounts listed on their website. Failure to do so may result in disqualification.\",\"giveawayFAQ9Q\":\"9. Are there any social media requirements?\",\"giveawayText1\":\"Watch the live stream of the exclusive Mansory Koenigsegg Jesko: Spartans edition driving event and step into the race of a lifetime!\",\"giveawayText2\":\"This isn't just a show - it's your chance to own the spotlight.\",\"giveawayText3\":\"Win a One of One Mansory Koenigsegg Jesko\",\"giveawayText4\":\"Are you ready to\",\"giveawayText5\":\"take the wheel?\",\"giveawayText6\":\"Register your Spartans account\",\"giveawayText7\":\"Deposit to activate your chance\",\"giveawayText8\":\"Enter the Mansory Koenigsegg Jesko: Spartans edition\",\"giveawayText9\":\"Compete \u0026 Win - it's that simple\",\"instantAccess\":\"Instant Access\",\"invalidFormat\":\"Invalid format\",\"invalidRegion\":\"Please enter a valid region name.\",\"joinThousands\":\"Join thousands o