re was an error trying to withdraw.\",\"accountSummary\":\"Account Summary\",\"activeSess"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ions\":\"Active Sessions\",\"addressInvalid\":\"Address is not valid\",\"affiliateArray\":[{\"title\":\"Spartans Affiliate Program:\",\"content\":\"The Spartans Affiliate Program is a player Affiliate initiative that allows you to earn rewards by introducing new players to Spartans.com. Whether you’re a content creator, business owner, average gambler, you can generate a passive commission by promoting Spartans to your friends, network or audience. \"},{\"title\":\"How do I join the Spartans Affiliate Program?:\",\"content\":\"To get started, please provide us with information regarding your service metrics by emailing commercials@spartans.com. Once your affiliate services are approved, we will provide you with your affiliate link, after which you may begin promoting it and earning passive commissions.\"},{\"title\":\"What are the benefits of the Spartans Affiliate Program?\",\"content\":\"As a Spartans affiliate, you’ll gain access to a wide range of advantages, including; highly competitive commission rates, real-time affiliate tracking system, professional marketing assets and, a huge opportunity to partner with a new fast-growing and highly engaging crypto casino. A fantastic way to lock in a long term passive income today!\"},{\"title\":\"I have a large audience. Can I get a custom deal?\",\"content\":\"We would love to work with you and you may be eligible for a custom deal. If you have a large social media following or a high-traffic website please contact our team at commercials@spartans.com. We would love to discuss custom deals tailored towards the size of your influence.\"},{\"title\":\"Is there a limit of how much commission I can earn?\",\"content\":\"No! There is no limit to how much you can earn. As long as your affiliates stay active on the website you will continue to earn commission. It’s performance based and the potential is endless! \"},{\"title\":\"Where can I advertise Spartans?\",\"content\":\"Spartans can be promoted in most countries worldwide, with the exception of locations restricted by licensing regulations. For a complete list of restricted locations please refer to our Terms of Service.\"}],\"affiliateTitle\":\"Affiliate\",\"afiliateText10\":\"Marketing Tools\",\"afiliateText11\":\"Get access to premium marketing materials to help you promote our products.\",\"afiliateText12\":\"How the Affiliate Program Works:\",\"afiliateText13\":\"Sign Up\",\"afiliateText14\":\"Fill out our registration form and wait for approval.\",\"afiliateText15\":\"Access the Platform\",\"afiliateText16\":\"Once approved, you’ll get full access to our affiliate platform and can start promoting.\",\"afiliateText17\":\"Earn Money\",\"afiliateText18\":\"Receive commissions for every active player you bring in!\",\"afiliateText19\":\"Choose Your Affiliate Model and Go Spartans!\",\"afiliateText20\":\"CPA Model\",\"afiliateText21\":\"Get a fixed payout for every player you refer.\",\"afiliateText22\":\"Revenue Share\",\"afiliateText23\":\"Earn a percentage of everything your players wager.\",\"afiliateText24\":\"Hybrid Model\",\"afiliateText25\":\"Get the best of both worlds: a fixed payout for each player plus a percentage of their wagers.\",\"ageRestriction\":\"You must be at least 18 years of age.\",\"amountAfterFee\":\"Total withdraw amount should be greater than 0\",\"authTitleLogin\":\"Continue to Spartans\",\"authTitleReset\":\"Reset your password\",\"bonusBuyCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"cashrakeActive\":\"CASHRAKE ACTIVE\",\"changeLanguage\":\"Change Language\",\"changePassword\":\"Change Password\",\"chooseCurrency\":\"Choose currency\",\"confirmAndSend\":\"Confirm \u0026 Send\",\"countryInvalid\":\"Country is not valid\",\"cryptocurrency\":\"Cryptocurrency\",\"currencyPrefix\":\"$$\",\"depositAndPlay\":\"Deposit Now!\",\"depositNetwork\":\"Choose Network\",\"depositOptions\":\"Deposit Options\",\"description2FA\":\"Enable Two-factor to protect your account from unauthorized access.\",\"destinationTag\":\"Destination Tag\",\"devMaintenance\":\"Dev \u0026 Maintenance\",\"enterExclusive\":\"Enter exclusive tournaments\",\"enterYourEmail\":\"Enter Your Email\",\"gamepaperFaq1A\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq1Q\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq2A\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq2Q\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq3A\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq3Q\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq4A\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq4Q\":\"\",\"gamepaper"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"Faq5A\":\"\",\"gamepaperFaq5Q\":\"\",\"giveawayEndsIn\":\"Giveaway ends in:\",\"giveawayFAQ10A\":\"Yes. Any evidence of: Multiple accounts Fraudulent activity Abuse or manipulation of the promotion will result in disqualification. Spartans.com may verify identities and take legal action if necessary.\",\"giveawayFAQ10Q\":\"10. Can I be disqualified?\",\"giveawayFAQ11A\":\"Yes. Spartans.com reserves the right to modify, suspend, or cancel the giveaway at any time without prior notice.\",\"giveawayFAQ11Q\":\"11. Can Spartans.com cancel or change the promotion?\",\"globalPartners\":\"Global Partners\",\"globalSettings\":\"Global Settings\",\"goToTheFaqPage\":\"Go to the FAQ page\",\"installAndroid\":\"Install Android\",\"invalidConfirm\":\"Confirm password is invalid\",\"invalidCountry\":\"Please select a valid Country\",\"invalid_amount\":\"Please enter a valid amount greater than 0.\",\"limitFillingUp\":\"LIMIT FILLING UP\",\"loyalityPoints\":\"Loyalty Points\",\"makeDepositNow\":\"Make a deposit now!\",\"manifestoArray\":[{\"title\":\"Written by the Founders\",\"content\":\"We didn't build Spartans to be another casino. We built it because the industry stopped respecting the player a long time ago. For years, bonuses and \\\"special offers\\\" were used as bait - tools to confuse, distract, and trap players in systems designed to take more than they give. We watched good people lose trust in the game itself. And honestly, we got tired of watching the same tricks win. So we tore the whole structure down.\"},{\"title\":\"No Bonuses - On Purpose\",\"content\":\"Bonuses didn’t make the industry better. They made it noisy. Dishonest. Complicated. So at Spartans, we removed them completely. No fake multipliers. No locked balances. No hoops to jump through. Your money is yours. Your bets are clean. Your outcomes are real. Not because it sounds good, but because it’s the truth. And because deep down we know YOU want to be free - free from tricks, free from fine print, free from the old system.\"},{\"title\":\"The Foundation\",\"content\":\"Entertainment was never the goal. Fairness was. Spartans is built on math - transparent, uncompromising math. Every rule is clear. Every outcome is provable. Trust isn’t promised here. It’s engineered.\"},{\"title\":\"The System - The 33% Rule\",\"content\":\"We asked ourselves: “How do you build a platform where the house doesn’t need to hide anything?” The answer became our core principle: you can earn up to 33% of your deposit as CashRake. Every wager counts—Rakeback is credited based on the house edge, while Cashback is credited on net losses. Not marketing. Not generosity. Just balance. We operate on the edge—transparently and sustainably.\"},{\"title\":\"The Principle\",\"content\":\"Spartans doesn’t reward you for entering. It rewards you for enduring. No sign-up bait. No withdrawal traps. No illusions of “boosted luck.” Every round is a handshake. Every bet is an honest contract. Fair. Measurable. Immutable.\"},{\"title\":\"The Code\",\"content\":\"Our values are simple: Transparency over noise. Math over marketing. Players over promises. We don’t chase whales. We don’t sell hope. We build systems that cannot lie.\"},{\"title\":\"The Future\",\"content\":\"Every casino before us belonged to the house. Spartans belongs to the player. No idols. No illusions. No hidden gears. Just pure probability, executed with integrity.\"},{\"title\":\"The Promise\",\"content\":\"Earn up to 33% of your deposit as CashRake. No bonuses. No confusion. No gimmicks. Just transparency—and the freedom you’ve been waiting for.\"}],\"monthlyPayouts\":\"Monthly Payouts\",\"noActivityHere\":\"There is no active activities.\",\"noBonusHistory\":\"No bonus history available.\",\"noResultsFound\":\"No Results Found\",\"passwordChange\":\"Password Change\",\"passwordLength\":\"Password must be at least 8 characters\",\"peopleReferred\":\"People Referred\",\"playerWinnings\":\"Player Winnings\",\"realEngagement\":\"Real engagement (not just views)\",\"regionRequired\":\"Region is required\",\"removeFavorite\":\"Remove Favorite\",\"repeatPassword\":\"Repeat New Password\",\"reviewTransfer\":\"Review Transfer\",\"searchForGames\":\"Search for games\",\"searchUsername\":\"Searc"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"h username\",\"secretKeyLabel\":\"Enter secret key\",\"selectCurrency\":\"Select\",\"selectInterval\":\"Please select a time interval.\",\"spinToMultiply\":\"Spin To Multiply Your Balance\",\"sportsWagerRTP\":\"CashRake is based on the house edge of each game or product. The house edge is the difference between 100% and the games RTP, which is the standard mathematical relationship between the two. For sportsbook, Spartans uses an RTP benchmark of 98, placing Sports within the 97.5–98.5 range.\",\"stats_currency\":\"Currency\",\"stillNeedWager\":\"Still need to wager\",\"tapTheMoreIcon\":\"Tap the more icon in the navigation bar. And then tap “Share” It looks like a square with an arrow pointing up.\",\"toggleFavorite\":\"Toggle favorite\",\"togglePassword\":\"Toggle password visibility\",\"totalReferrals\":\"Total Referrals\",\"transferFailed\":\"Transfer Failed\",\"twoFASecretKey\":\"Secret key\",\"twoFactorTitle\":\"2FA Activation\",\"updatePassword\":\"Update Password\",\"verifyAndLogin\":\"Verify and Login\",\"verifyIdentity\":\"Verify Email\",\"viewInCurrency\":\"View In Currency\",\"voteOnPlatform\":\"Vote on platform upgrades (coming Q1 2026)\",\"watchStreamer