e can contain only letters and numbers\",\"usernameTooLong\":\"Username must be at most 15 characters long\",\"voiceOfTheArena\":\"The Voice of the Arena\",\"watchTheStories\":\"WATCH THE STORIES\",\"weWillSendReset\":\"We’ll send a reset link to this address.\",\"withdrawAddress\":\"Withdraw Address\",\"withdrawNetwork\":\"Withdraw Network\",\"withdrawSuccess\":\"Withdraw was successful.\",\"acceptHigherInfo\":\"The change you made in your bet settings will also be valid for your future bets. If you want to change your choice of odds change preferences, you can do so in the bet settings section.\",\"affiliateProgram\":\"Affiliate Program\",\"auditDescription\":\"We have audited our platform through the world's leading blockchain auditing firms to ensure security, transparency, and reliability. Player safety is our top priority - and we've got the proof to back it up.\",\"authDescRegister\":\"Sign up with your email, choose a username, and set a secure password.\",\"availableBalance\":\"Available Balance\",\"backToPromotions\":\"Back to promotions\",\"bettingSuspended\":\"Betting is currently suspended for this Event\",\"bonusBuyAllGames\":\"ALL GAMES\",\"bonusBuyBonusBuy\":\"Bonus Buy\",\"bonusBuyDirectly\":\"Buy Bonuses Directly\",\"bonusBuyTryAgain\":\"Try Again\",\"bonusHistoryType\":\"Type\",\"cancelWithdrawal\":\"Cancel Withdrawal\",\"cashRakeInfoText\":\"Your CashRake is paid instantly, every minute. Thank you for playing at Spartans!\",\"cashrake_history\":\"Cashrake history\",\"cashrake_youHave\":\"You have\",\"closeWalletModal\":\"Close wallet modal\",\"depositExclusive\":\"Get 300% extra on your deposit\",\"depositHowToInfo\":\"Need help depositing? click here for a step-by-step guide.\",\"earnFromClipping\":\"Earn from clipping\",\"enterNewPassword\":\"Enter New Password\",\"enterPhoneNumber\":\"Enter your phone number\",\"faq_allQuestions\":\"All Questions\",\"forIphoneAndIpad\":\"For iPhone \u0026 iPad (Safari)\",\"influencersFaq1A\":\"\",\"influencersFaq1Q\":\"\",\"influencersFaq2A\":\"\",\"influencersFaq2Q\":\"\",\"influencersFaq3A\":\"\",\"influencersFaq3Q\":\"\",\"influencersFaq4A\":\"\",\"influencersFaq4Q\":\"\",\"influencersFaq5A\":\"\",\"influencersFaq5Q\":\"\",\"influencersFaq6A\":\"\",\"influencersFaq6Q\":\"\",\"joinOurCommunity\":\"Join our Community!\",\"leaderb_col_user\":\"User\",\"linkExpiredTitle\":\"Link Expired\",\"liveWinGameImage\":\"Live Win Game\",\"maintenanceTitle\":\"Under Maintenance\",\"makeFirstDeposit\":\"Deposit Now\",\"noBetsWithPeriod\":\"No bets placed yet.\",\"passwordRequired\":\"Password is required\",\"passwordStrength\":\"Password needs to have at least 8 characters, one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one number and one special character\",\"pendingUserEvent\":\"Pending User Event\",\"pending_approval\":\"Pending Approval\",\"platformTreasury\":\"Platform Treasury\",\"poiFrontRequired\":\"POI (Front) is required\",\"postWagerRewards\":\"Post-Wager Rewards\",\"readOurManifesto\":\"Read our manifesto and spread our 33% CashRake.\",\"referralCampaign\":\"Campaign\",\"referralFAQArray\":[{\"a\":\"The Spartans Affiliate Program allows you to earn commissions by referring new players to the platform. For every bet placed by users you refer in Casino or Sportsbook, you earn a percentage commission — for life.\",\"q\":\"What is the Spartans Affiliate Program?\",\"category\":\"general\"},{\"a\":\"Anyone with a registered Spartans account can join the Affiliate Program. Simply navigate to the Affiliate Program page and start sharing your unique referral link.\",\"q\":\"Who can join the Spartans Affiliate Program?\",\"category\":\"general\"},{\"a\":\"To join, go to the Affiliate Program page, copy your u"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"nique affiliate link, and share it with your audience. When someone signs up using your link and places bets, you start earning commission.\",\"q\":\"How do I join the Spartans Affiliate Program?\",\"category\":\"general\"},{\"a\":\"Benefits include lifetime commission on all referred players' bets, instant payouts, support for crypto and local currencies, customisable commission plans, and 24/7 multi-language support.\",\"q\":\"What are the benefits of joining the Spartans Affiliate Programs?\",\"category\":\"general\"},{\"a\":\"Yes, we provide 24/7 multi-language support to assist you in your preferred language at any time of day.\",\"q\":\"Is there support available if I have questions?\",\"category\":\"general\"},{\"a\":\"You earn commission for all bets placed by your referrals across both our Casino and Sportsbook products. There is no limit to how many people you can refer.\",\"q\":\"How does the Referral Program work?\",\"category\":\"referral-program\"},{\"a\":\"You benefit from Lifetime Commission. As long as the players you refer continue to play, you will continue to get paid indefinitely.\",\"q\":\"How long will I earn commission from a referred player?\",\"category\":\"referral-program\"},{\"a\":\"We offer Instant Payouts, meaning you skip the wait and see your earnings reflected in your account balance immediately.\",\"q\":\"When do I receive my commission payouts?\",\"category\":\"referral-program\"},{\"a\":\"The program is flexible, allowing you to earn your commission in both cryptocurrencies and various local currencies.\",\"q\":\"What currencies are supported for earnings?\",\"category\":\"earnings\"},{\"a\":\"The default commission rate is 10%. However, if you have a large following or exceptional reach, you can contact our Referral Team to discuss a customized program with higher rates.\",\"q\":\"What is the default commission rate?\",\"category\":\"earnings\"},{\"a\":\"Casino commission is based on the house edge of the specific game played. It is calculated using the formula: Edge as decimal × wagered / 2) × commission rate\",\"q\":\"How is Casino commission calculated?\",\"category\":\"earnings\"},{\"a\":\"All sports bets are calculated using a 3% theoretical house edge. The formula used is: (0.03 × wagered / 2) × commission rate\",\"q\":\"How is Sportsbook commission calculated?\",\"category\":\"earnings\"}],\"referralVipLevel\":\"VIP Level\",\"remainingBalance\":\"Remaining Balance\",\"searchFiatCrypto\":\"Search (Fiat, Crypto)\",\"stats_statistics\":\"Statistics\",\"tapTheMoreButton\":\"Tap the More Button\",\"toggleFullscreen\":\"Toggle fullscreen\",\"totalWithdrawals\":\"Total Withdrawals\",\"usernameNotFound\":\"No users with that username have been found.\",\"usernameRequired\":\"Username is required\",\"usernameTooShort\":\"Username must be at least 5 characters long\",\"verificationCode\":\"Verification Code\",\"weHaveGotAnswers\":\"We’ve Got Answers.\",\"withdrawCurrency\":\"Withdraw Currency\",\"yourReferralCode\":\"Your Referral Code\",\"yourTotalBalance\":\"Your Total Balance\",\"auditCard1Bullet1\":\"Penetration test \u0026 infrastructure audit\",\"auditCard1Bullet2\":\"No critical vulnerabilities found\",\"auditCard1Bullet3\":\"Fully compliant with crypto gaming standards\",\"auditCard2Bullet1\":\"Smart contract audit completed\",\"auditCard2Bullet2\":\"On-chain monitoring enabled\",\"auditCard2Bullet3\":\"Score available on Certik leaderboard\",\"auditCard3Bullet1\":\"Smart contract audit completed\",\"auditCard3Bullet2\":\"On-chain monitoring enabled\",\"auditCard3Bullet3\":\"Score available on Certik leaderboard\",\"authTitleRegister\":\"Create your Spartans account\",\"bonusBuyBonusBuys\":\"Bonus Buys\",\"bonusBuyClearList\":\"Clear List\",\"bonusHistoryEmpty\":\"No bonus history found.\",\"byClickingDeposit\":\"By clicking the deposit button below, you agree\",\"cashrakeGoToLobby\":\"CashRake Games\",\"cashrakeLimitUsed\":\"Cashrake Limit Used\",\"cashrakeToast_btn\":\"Got It\",\"cashrakeToast_msg\":\"$${earn} has been credited.\",\"cashrake_expiring\":\"Expiring\",\"closeOddsSettings\":\"Close odds settings\",\"confirmAndInstall\":\"Confirm and Install\",\"confirmEmailTitle\":\"Email confirmation sent\",\"confirmM