n ID\",\"referralCodePlaceholder\":\"Enter Referral Code\",\"referralCommissionIntro\":\"View and track the earnings you've generated through your referrals — a clear breakdown of commissions and payouts.\",\"referralCommissionRules\":\"Commission Rules\",\"referralConfirmTransfer\":\"Confirm Transfer\",\"referralContactTeamLink\":\"contact our Referral Team\",\"referralFilterOnlyLocal\":\"Only Show Local Currencies\",\"referralLastDepositDate\":\"Last Deposit Date\",\"referralNoReferredUsers\":\"No Referred Users\",\"referralOverviewHeading\":\"Overview\",\"referralTransferInclude\":\"INCLUDE\",\"securityPhoneNumberDesc\":\"Bind your phone number to receive instant security alerts.\",\"showroomCardDescription\":\"The community vibe is electric, filled with creativity.\",\"sponsor_lilbaby_title_1\":\"Lil Baby, the new era of winners\",\"sponsor_lilbaby_title_2\":\"Spartans joins forces with Lil Baby\",\"sponsor_lilbaby_title_3\":\"What to expect\",\"sponsor_nina_subtitle_1\":\"01. The Profile\",\"sponsor_nina_subtitle_2\":\"02. The Alliance\",\"sponsor_nina_subtitle_3\":\"03. The Future\",\"tapTheMoreButtonAndroid\":\"Tap the 'More' button in the right corner of the browser. The button location may vary for some users.\",\"targetedWelcomeLinkHref\":\"https://t.me/SpartansHOC\",\"targetedWelcomeLinkText\":\"https://t.me/SpartansHOC\",\"toastError_NoBalanceBet\":\"You don't have enough balance to place this bet.\",\"toastError_SameBetError\":\"You cannot place multiple bets on the same event.\",\"whyCreators1Description\":\"Weekly reward pool based on engagement, reach, and referrals.\",\"whyCreators2Description\":\"Trackable links, dashboards, promo codes \u0026 real-time earnings reports.\",\"whyCreators3Description\":\"Be featured across our homepage, blog, and community channels.\",\"withdrawalLastUsedLabel\":\"Last withdrawal:\",\"yourEntriesTextGiveaway\":\"Your Entries\",\"andrew_officialPartnerOf\":\"Official Partner of\",\"bonusBuyNoBalanceWarning\":\"You have no balance. Deposit funds to continue.\",\"bonusBuyRemainingBalance\":\"Remaining Balance\",\"conorbenn_bottomHeadText\":\"Conor Benn × Spartans Partnership\",\"filtersSortByOptionsName\":\"name\",\"frequentlyAskedQuestions\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"fuelOfTheSpartansEconomy\":\"$$SPAR is the fuel of the Spartans economy. You can use $SPAR to:\",\"gameCurrencyNotSupported\":\"This currency is not supported, please continue with different one.\",\"minWithAmountAndCurrency\":\"Min: {{amount}} {{currency}}\",\"newFeatureUnlockedBadge1\":\" Rakeback\",\"newFeatureUnlockedBadge2\":\" Loss Cashback (Max)\",\"newFeatureUnlockedBadge3\":\"Instant • No Wagering\",\"profitAmountWithCurrency\":\"Profit Amount ({{currency}})\",\"promotionBackgroundImage\":\"Promotions background\",\"referralCodeDoesNotExist\":\"This referral code does not exist.\",\"referralDateCreatedLabel\":\"Date Created:\",\"referralExportModalTitle\":\"Export\",\"referralFilterModalTitle\":\"Filter\",\"referralFilterOnlyCrypto\":\"Only Show Crypto Currencies\",\"referralNoCampaignsFound\":\"No Campaigns Found.\",\"referralTabReferredUsers\":\"Referred Users\",\"referralTemplatesHeading\":\"Templates to Help Your Campaign Stand Out\",\"referralTransferComplete\":\"Tr"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ansfer Complete\",\"referralTransferFiatHint\":\"Checked currencies are included in this transfer. Unchecked fiat stays as commission. Crypto with balance is always included.\",\"resetPasswordDescription\":\"Enter your E-mail to send reset password link.\",\"selfExclusionConfirmText\":\"Are you sure you want to continue? This action will temporarily disable your account.\",\"selfExclusionDescription\":\"By requesting one of our self-exclusion time periods on offer you agree to the following terms and conditions, which will be effective from the minute you receive a confirmation email of your chosen self-exclusion, this email will be sent to the email address used to register your account only and will display the date of self-exclusion completion.\",\"sponsor_arman_subtitle_1\":\"01. The Profile\",\"sponsor_arman_subtitle_2\":\"02. The Alliance\",\"sponsor_arman_subtitle_3\":\"03. The Future\",\"sponsor_conor_subtitle_1\":\"01. The Profile\",\"sponsor_conor_subtitle_2\":\"02. The Alliance\",\"sponsor_conor_subtitle_3\":\"03. The Future\",\"sponsor_era_content_1_p1\":\"Era Istrefi is the intersection of rebellion and elegance. Emerging from the heart of the Balkans to command the global stage, she hasn’t just followed the rhythm of the industry—she has rewritten it. Her journey is a masterclass in authenticity, turning a distinct cultural identity into a universal language of power.\",\"sponsor_era_content_1_p2\":\"A genre-defying artist, fashion icon, and fearless creator, Era represents the strength found in staying true to one's origin while evolving at the speed of light. She is the embodiment of identity refined by influence.  That’s why Spartans stands with her. She symbolizes a new era of creators: those who turn heritage into a weapon, silence into a symphony, and a singular voice into a global movement.\",\"sponsor_era_content_2_p1\":\"a partnership forged in rhythm, rebellion, and radiance. Together, we’re uniting the magnetic energy of a global icon with the precision and performance that define Spartans.\",\"sponsor_era_content_2_p2\":\"This collaboration celebrates the art of the breakthrough: exclusive content, immersive experiences, and rewards crafted for those who define their own tempo. With Era’s visionary influence, Spartans continues to push boundaries, blending cultural excellence with elite digital innovation.\",\"sponsor_era_content_2_p3\":\"Spartans and Era Istrefi — built for the bold, powered by identity.\",\"sponsor_era_content_3_p1\":\"Elevating the player experience by fusing the high-octane energy of global pop with exclusive access, rapid payouts, and the groundbreaking 33% instant CashRake. On Spartans, we celebrate the bold - where every play is a statement, and every move keeps you in the spotlight.\",\"sponsor_raf_content_1_p1\":\"There's a moment in every match where technique meets instinct. That's where Real American Freestyle lives. It didn't reinvent wrestling -  it stripped it back to what actually matters: preparation, pressure, and the refusal to fold.\",\"sponsor_raf_content_1_p2\":\"SPARTANS.COM  sees that same energy in everything we do. High stakes, no hesitation. We move at the speed of people who came to win and so does RAF.\",\"sponsor_raf_content_2_p1\":\"This isn't a sponsorship. It's a match made on the mat.\",\"sponsor_raf_content_2_p2\":\"Spartans and RAF share the same DNA — high pressure, no excuses, and a standard that doesn't bend. We're bringing that same intensity into the digital space. Real access, real stakes, built for athletes and fans who actually have skin in the game.\",\"sponsor_raf_content_2_p3\":\"Spartans x RAF. For the ones who grind when it's not glamorous.\",\"sponsor_raf_content_3_p1\":\"The best wrestlers in the room share one thing, they came ready. So did we. Spartans is matching RAF's energy rep for rep: rapid payouts, the 33% instant CashRake, and access that's built for people who actually show up. No waiting, no watered-down odds… just a platform that moves as fast as you do.\",\"stats_somethingWentWrong\":\"Something went wrong\",\"targetedWelcomeUsernames\":[\"ziyabostanci\"],\"toastError_emailNotFound\":\"E-mail addre"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ss not found, please check email address and try again.\",\"toastSuccess_BonusCancel\":\"Bonus cancelled successfully\",\"yourPositionTextGiveaway\":\"Your Position\",\"yourSpinResultMultiplied\":\"Your Balance Has Been Multiplied!\",\"addSpartansYourHomeScreen\":\"Add Spartans to Your Home Screen (iOS)\",\"areYouReadyToTakeTheWheel\":\"Are you ready to take the wheel?\",\"bonusBuyGamesAndBonusBuys\":\"Games \u0026 Bonus Buys\",\"changeLanguageDescription\":\"Select the desired language to display.\",\"changePasswordDescription\":\"Choose your new password.\",\"countryBlockedDescription\":\"This website is not available in your country.\",\"depositFiatAmountRequired\":\"Amount is required\",\"depositToCountinueEarning\":\"Deposit to Continue Earning\",\"depositWarningsGuidelines\":\"3. Please follow the deposit guideline to make deposit, otherwise your deposit will be missing.\",\"filtersPlaceholdersSearch\":\"Search bonus...\",\"foundBugOrRecommendations\":\"Found a bug? Or have any recommendations? Please leave your message here and our team will work on it!\",\"howCashrakeYourLimitTitle\":\"Know Your Status\",\"leaderb_countdown_minutes\":\"Minutes\",\"leaderb_countdown_seconds\":\"Seconds\",\"lilbaby_officialPartnerOf\":\"Official Partner of\",\"manifestoBannerSocialText\":\"OUR POWER IS YOU - Read our manifesto and spread our 33% CashRake.\",\"pagesPolicyPageTitleTitle\":\"Terms of Use\",\"pagesProvidersDescription\":\"Find the best providers in the market\",\"previousWithdrawalAddress\":\"Previous Withdrawal Address\",\"referralCampaignLinkLabel\":\"Campaign Link\",\"referralCampaignNameLabel\":\"Campaign Name\",\"referralCompareSelectUpTo\":\"Select up to five campaigns to compare\",\"referralFirstTimeDeposits\":\"First Time Deposits\",\"referralSportsbookFormula\":\"(0.03 × wagered / 2) × commission_rate\",\"referralSportsbookSection\":\"Sportsbook\",\"referralTransferToBalance\":\"Transfer to Balance\",\"repeatLatestDepositCrypto\":\"Repeat your latest crypto deposit\",\"rewardsCountdownExpiresIn\":\"Expires in:\",\"securityEmailVerification\":\"Email Verification\",\"securityEmailVerifiedDesc\":\"Your email has been verified. Thank you for confirming your email address.\",\"securityLoginPasswordDesc\":\"Your account is secured, click below to change your password. We recommend using a strong password that you haven't used before.\",\"serviceMissingAltProvider\":\"Missing provider\",\"sponsor_andrew_subtitle_1\":\"01. The Profile\",\"sponsor_andrew_subtitle_2\":\"02. The Alliance\",\"sponsor_andrew_subtitle_3\":\"03. The Future\",\"sponsor_era_list_3_item_1\":\"Odds Elevated! Unlock legendary wins with Era’s curated Iconic Markets - exclusive odds and special events inspired by her global hits, found only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_era_list_3_item_2\":\"Win an Exclusive Piece of the Era Aesthetic: Enter for a chance to win signed, limited-edition Era Istrefi memorabilia—available exclusively to Spartans players.\",\"sponsor_era_list_3_item_3\":\"Experience The Era Istrefi Collection: Immerse yourself in a world of rhythm and high-stakes style with exclusive games crafted for the fearless, found only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_nina_content_1_p1\":\"Nina Drama is the wrecking ball of the fight world. She didn't wait for an invite to the combat sports inner circle; she kicked the door down and started asking the questions no one else dared to. Her path is a masterclass in staying unscripted, turning awkward tension and raw personality into a global brand that dominates every feed.\",\"sponsor_nina_content_1_p2\":\"A digital disruptor and a fearless voice in the trenches, Nina is proof that authenticity is more powerful than a polished script. She represents the Main Character energy that keeps the industry on its toes. That’s why Spartans stands with her. She leads a new wave of icons: those who turn a mic-drop into a movement and a singular moment of chaos into a worldwide takeover.\",\"sponsor_nina_content_2_p1\":\"A partnership built on hype, heat, and zero filters. We’re slamming Nina’s unpredictable energy into the high-performance engine of Spartans.\",\"sponsor_nina_content_2_p2\":\"This collab is about the Plot Twist—giving you backstage access that usually requires a press pass"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,", high-stakes arenas, and rewards for those who thrive when the pressure is on. With Nina’s don't care attitude, Spartans is trashing the boring industry standard—fusing the adrenaline of the fight game with the future of digital betting.\",\"sponsor_nina_content_2_p3\":\"Spartans and Nina Drama — built for the loud, powered by the hustle.\",\"sponsor_nina_content_3_p1\":\"We’re cutting the fluff and getting straight to the action. We’ve combined the raw hype of the combat world with instant payouts and the 33% instant CashRake. At Spartans, we play for the highlight reel—where every bet is a gamble on greatness and every win is a middle finger to the average.\",\"sponsor_raf_list_3_item_1\":\"Championship Markets  Odds and lines handpicked from RAF's most explosive matchups. Exclusive to Spartans.\",\"sponsor_raf_list_3_item_2\":\"Claim Your Piece of the Mat  Win authenticated, limited-edition RAF gear and signed memorabilia. Real stuff, real scarcity.\",\"sponsor_raf_list_3_item_3\":\"The RAF Arena  Step into a world designed around peak performance. Exclusive games, built for the relentless.\",\"sponsor_x7dave_subtitle_1\":\"01. The Profile\",\"sponsor_x7dave_subtitle_2\":\"02. The Alliance\",\"sponsor_x7dave_subtitle_3\":\"03. The Future\",\"tapTheAddHomeBelowTheList\":\"Tap the Add to home screen button below the list.\",\"toastError_EnterPromoCode\":\"Please enter a promo code.\",\"toastError_FailedPlaceBet\":\"Failed to place bet.\",\"toastError_LockedEventBet\":\"You cannot place bets on locked events.\",\"transactionStatus_failure\":\"Failed\",\"transactionStatus_pending\":\"Pending\",\"transactionStatus_success\":\"Success\",\"transferFailedDescription\":\"We couldn't complete your transfer.\",\"viewInCurrencyDescription\":\"Select the desired currency to display. The Currencies will be shown in approximated values.\",\"welcomeToAffiliateProgram\":\"Welcome to our affiliate program\",\"yourTotalCashRakeProgress\":\"Your Total CashRake Progress\",\"betBuilderErrorForMultiple\":\"BetBuilder selections cannot be combined with other selections in the same betslip.\",\"bonusBuyBrowseAllProviders\":\"Browse All\",\"bonusBuyPurchaseSuccessful\":\"Purchase Successful!\",\"bonusBuySortPriceHighToLow\":\"Price - High to Low\",\"bonusBuySortPriceLowToHigh\":\"Price - Low to High\",\"bonusBuyWelcomeDescription\":\"World First. Exclusive to Spartans: Buy Bonus Buys directly from the Marketplace. No more game-by-game searching - load up as many bonus buys before you play.\",\"cashrake_limitReachedTitle\":\"Earning Status\",\"cashrake_yourCashrakeLimit\":\"Your new CashRake limit is {limit}\",\"depositWarningsAmountMatch\":\"1. Your transfer amount has to MATCH the submission amount.\",\"gameNotAvailableInCurrency\":\"Your view in currency isn't supported. Choose from below:\",\"giveAwayEnterChallengeText\":\"Enter the {campaignName} Challenge\",\"howCashrakeModalMainStatus\":\"Your Main Status Modal\",\"howCashrakeYourLimitTitle2\":\"We've updated the UI so you always know exactly where you stand.\",\"liveWinCurrencyApproximate\":\"~ {{code}} {{amount}}\",\"mansoryKoenigseggParagraph\":\"Win the ultra-exclusive 1/1 Spartans X Mansory Koenigsegg Jesko the world's most extreme hypercar masterpiece! Custom-built with Mansory's savage aero, 1600+ HP twin-turbo V8, and 0-60 in under 2.5s this one-of-one legend is YOURS in our giveaway!\",\"passwordChangedDescription\":\"Please sign in again.\",\"pendingBonusBuyHideDetails\":\"Hide Details\",\"pendingBonusBuyViewDetails\":\"View Details\",\"playLimitNoticeDescription\":\"Please be advised that your account currently has specific play limits in place\",\"playLimitUsdEquivalentNote\":\"(Amount will be calculated as the USD equivalent and applied to your account currency)\",\"referralCampaignIdMinChars\":\"Must be 9–14 characters\",\"referralCasinoFormulaIntro\":\"All games have a different house edge. Derive your commission using the formula:\",\"referralExportSelectSingle\":\"Please select a single campaign to export.\",\"referralLifetimeCommission\":\"Lifetime Commission\",\"referralMetricCampaignHits\":\"Campaign Hits\",\"referralPerformanceSummary\":\"Performance Summary\",\"referralProcessingTransfer\":\"Processing Transfer\",\"referralReferredUs"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ersIntro\":\"Track all the users who joined through your referral link. Here you can see their activity and gameplay - making it easy to monitor the growth of your network and the benefits you're gaining from referrals.\",\"referralTemplatesBannerAlt\":\"Templates Banner\",\"referralTotalReferredUsers\":\"Total Referred Users\",\"referralTransferModalTitle\":\"Transfer Commission\",\"registerPasswordLowerError\":\"Password must contain at least 2 lowercase letters.\",\"registerPasswordUpperError\":\"Password must contain at least 1 uppercase letter.\",\"spartansInfluencersProgram\":\"SPARTANS Influencer Program\",\"sponsor_arman_content_1_p1\":\"Arman Tsarukyan blends tactical precision with relentless force. Rising from his Armenian roots to the top of the lightweight division, he hasn’t just climbed the ranks—he’s broken through them, using elite wrestling and striking to dominate.\",\"sponsor_arman_content_1_p2\":\"A hybrid athlete and strategic force, Arman represents discipline, speed, and modern performance. That’s why Spartans stands with him—he embodies a new generation of fighters turning focus and preparation into lasting dominance.\",\"sponsor_arman_content_2_p1\":\"A partnership forged in grit, geometry, and the pursuit of gold. Together, we’re fusing the high-stakes intensity of a title contender with the precision and performance that define Spartans.\",\"sponsor_arman_content_2_p2\":\"This collaboration celebrates precision: exclusive content, immersive fight-week experiences, and rewards for those in control. With Arman’s drive, Spartans pushes boundaries, merging elite MMA with digital innovation.\",\"sponsor_arman_content_2_p3\":\"Spartans and Arman Tsarukyan — built for the relentless, powered by the plan.\",\"sponsor_arman_content_3_p1\":\"We are amplifying the action by fusing the high-velocity energy of the UFC with exclusive access, rapid payouts, and the groundbreaking 33% instant CashRake. On Spartans, we honor the aggressor—where every scramble is a statement, and every tactical adjustment keeps you ahead of the curve.\",\"sponsor_conor_content_1_p1\":\"Conor Benn embodies raw determination, precision, and evolution. Born into a legacy yet defined by his own grit, he has forged his path through discipline and relentless ambition. From early training sessions to global arenas, his rise reflects an unwavering pursuit of greatness.\",\"sponsor_conor_content_1_p2\":\"A world-class boxer, entrepreneur, and modern-day competitor, Benn represents the balance of heritage and innovation: power refined by purpose. That’s why Spartans stands with him. He symbolizes a new generation of fighters: those who turn pressure into performance, setbacks into comebacks, and passion into lasting victory.\",\"sponsor_conor_content_2_p1\":\"Spartans x Conor Benn - a partnership forged in drive, discipline, and distinction. Together, we’re uniting the relentless energy of a world-class fighter with the precision and performance that define Spartans.\",\"sponsor_conor_content_2_p2\":\"This collaboration celebrates strength in motion: exclusive content, unmatched experiences, and rewards crafted for those who demand more from the game. With Benn in our corner, Spartans continues to push boundaries, blending athletic excellence with elite gaming innovation.\",\"sponsor_conor_content_2_p3\":\"Spartans and Conor Benn - built for champions, powered by ambition!\",\"sponsor_conor_content_3_p1\":\"Spartans x Conor Benn: elevating the player experience with exclusive access, rapid payouts, and the groundbreaking 33% instant CashRake. On Spartans, every play counts, and even setbacks turn into wins.\",\"sponsor_lilbaby_subtitle_1\":\"01. The Profile\",\"sponsor_lilbaby_subtitle_2\":\"02. The Alliance\",\"sponsor_lilbaby_subtitle_3\":\"03. The Future\",\"sponsor_nina_list_3_item_1\":\"Crush the book with The Drama Board—exclusive lines and specialized markets fueled by Nina’s wildest fight-night predictions, found only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_nina_list_3_item_2\":\"Own the Highlight Reel: Enter for a chance to win signed, limited-edition Nina Drama collectibles and Drama Club gear—available exc"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"lusively to Spartans players.\",\"sponsor_nina_list_3_item_3\":\"The Drama Collection: Burn the rulebook with exclusive games built for those who live for the Main Event energy, found only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_sweetflips_title_1\":\"Who are SweetFlips?\",\"sponsor_sweetflips_title_2\":\"SweetFlips Strengthens the Community\",\"sponsor_sweetflips_title_3\":\"SweetFlips × Spartans\",\"targetedWelcomeContactHref\":\"mailto:lewis@Spartans.com\",\"targetedWelcomeContactText\":\"lewis@Spartans.com\",\"toastError_KycFormDisabled\":\"You are not allowed to submit a KYC request at this time.\",\"toastError_NoBonusSelected\":\"No bonus selected\",\"toastSuccess_AddedFavorite\":\"Added to favorites successfully\",\"transactionStatus_rejected\":\"Rejected\",\"withdrawalLastUsedUseAgain\":\"Use again\",\"affiliateProgramDescription\":\"Our affiliate program is a partnership opportunity designed for individuals looking to earn a commission by promoting the casino's services. As an affiliate, you are provided with a unique referral link to share with your audience. Whenever a new user signs up and makes a deposit through your link, you receive a percentage of that deposit as a commission.\",\"bonusBuyMaximumLimitWarning\":\"Maximum 20 total bonus buys allowed.\",\"bonusBuyTryAdjustingFilters\":\"Try adjusting your filters or search query\",\"cashrake_earnedAndLimitInfo\":\"You have earned ${earned} of your ${limit} total limit.\",\"emailChangeErrorDescription\":\"There was an error changing your email. Please try again.\",\"globalReachAndAccessibility\":\"Global Reach and Accessibility\",\"howCashrakeWorksDescription\":\"The more you play, the more you get back. Instantly.\",\"howCashrakeWorksRewardsText\":\"It's not just rewards. It's simple math. Here is exactly how we calculate your 33% return.\",\"installSpartansAppYourPhone\":\"Install SPARTANS APP on Your Phone\",\"pagesSportBreadcrumbsSoccer\":\"Soccer\",\"pendingBonusBuyPlayNextGame\":\"Play Next Game\",\"referralAvailableCommission\":\"Available Commission\",\"referralCampaignCreatedDate\":\"Campaign Created Date\",\"referralCreateCampaignTitle\":\"Create Campaign\",\"referralExclusiveAdvantages\":\"Exclusive Advantages\",\"referralFilterOnlyLocalDesc\":\"Display all local currency commissions.\",\"referralMetricReferredUsers\":\"Referred Users\",\"referralSortFtdHighLowLabel\":\"First Time Deposits: High to Low\",\"referralSortFtdLowHighLabel\":\"First Time Deposits: Low to High\",\"referralSortLifetimeHighLow\":\"Lifetime Commission: High to Low\",\"referralSortLifetimeLowHigh\":\"Lifetime Commission: Low to High\",\"referralSortReferredHighLow\":\"Referred Users: High to Low\",\"referralSortReferredLowHigh\":\"Referred Users: Low to High\",\"referralTooltipCampaignHits\":\"Total number of times your referral links have been clicked\",\"referralTransferFiatSummary\":\"Fiat — summary\",\"referralTransferNoSelection\":\"No currencies selected for transfer.\",\"referralWithdrawnCommission\":\"Withdrawn Commission\",\"registerPasswordLengthError\":\"Password must be between 6 and 15 characters.\",\"registerPasswordNumberError\":\"Password must contain at least 1 number.\",\"registerUsernameLengthError\":\"Username must be between 5 and 20 characters.\",\"rewardsCountdownAvailableIn\":\"Available in:\",\"secureAndResponsibleBetting\":\"Secure and Responsible Betting\",\"sponsor_andrew_content_1_p1\":\"Andrew Tate exemplifies the spirit of excellence, built on discipline, resilience, and a relentless pursuit of success. From his beginnings as a world champion kickboxer to his evolution into a global entrepreneur, he has redefined what it means to master both mind and body. His story is one of self-determination, strategic ambition, and unwavering confidence. That’s why Spartans stands behind him. He represents a new generation of high performers: individuals who turn challenges into victories, pressure into progress, and vision into lasting influence.\",\"sponsor_andrew_content_2_p1\":\"Andrew Tate embodies precision, discipline, and success-values that align seamlessly with the Spartans ethos. His pursuit of mastery and distinction mirrors our own commitment to setting new standards in performance and reward.\",\"sponsor_andrew_content_2_p2\":\"Sparta"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ns exists for those who expect more: refined execution, rapid payouts, and an experience defined by integrity and excellence. We don’t follow the market! we redefine it, giving back to our players and elevating the game at every turn.\",\"sponsor_andrew_content_2_p3\":\"Andrew Tate x Spartans: a collaboration shaped by ambition, built on performance, and curated for those who lead.\",\"sponsor_andrew_content_3_p1\":\"Spartans x Tate: redefining the player experience with exclusive access, lightning-fast payouts, and the groundbreaking 33% instant CashRake. On Spartans, every moment counts, and even losses turn into wins.\",\"sponsor_arman_list_3_item_1\":\"Unlock legendary victories with Arman’s curated Championship Lines exclusive odds and special betting events inspired by his most iconic victories, found only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_arman_list_3_item_2\":\"Win a Piece of the Fight: Enter for a chance to win signed, limited-edition Arman Tsarukyan memorabilia and training gear—available exclusively to Spartans players.\",\"sponsor_arman_list_3_item_3\":\"Enter the Tsarukyan Collection: Immerse yourself in a world of technical mastery and high-stakes combat with exclusive games crafted for the fearless, found only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_conor_list_3_item_1\":\"Odds elevated! Unlock massive wins with Conor Benn’s exclusive boxing markets only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_conor_list_3_item_2\":\"Win an exclusive signed Conor Benn boxing glove: available exclusively to Spartans players.\",\"sponsor_conor_list_3_item_3\":\"Experience The Conor Benn Collection: exclusive games crafted for champions, found only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_x7dave_content_1_p1\":\"X7Dave brings the Caribbean heat straight to your screen—immaculate vibes, humour off the charts, and a presence that's impossible to ignore. But don't let the laid-back charm fool you. Beneath the sunshine and beach energy is a sharp, strategic mind that studies the game, masters it, and makes victory look effortless.\",\"sponsor_x7dave_content_1_p2\":\"He's consistency with charisma. Relentless discipline fuels his every move. Pressure doesn't shake him—it ignites him. More than just a name in the scene, X7Dave represents what it means to compete at the highest level: precision, focus, and a competitive fire that burns hotter under pressure.\",\"sponsor_x7dave_content_2_p1\":\"Spartans just got stronger. The world's top streamer joins the ranks, and everything changes today. This partnership unites two powerhouses through a shared vision: precision, performance, and ambition without limits. X7Dave brings his strategic genius and generous spirit to a platform built for those who demand more from every moment. Together, we're not just creating opportunities—we're redefining what's possible in competitive entertainment.\",\"sponsor_x7dave_content_2_p2\":\"With X7Dave on board, Spartans is delivering exclusive experiences, elevated rewards, and high-performance opportunities designed for a community that refuses to settle. This is more than an alliance. This is the beginning of a new era.\",\"sponsor_x7dave_content_2_p3\":\"Spartans x X7Dave - built for focus, powered by ambition.\",\"sponsor_x7dave_content_3_p1\":\"The biggest casino leaderboard the world has ever seen is here. $2,000,000 on the line. \",\"sponsor_x7dave_conte