your chance, and race towards the ultimate reward.\",\"pendingBonusBuyStartAllGames\":\"Start All Games\",\"pendingBonusBuyStatusInQueue\":\"In Queue\",\"pendingBonusBuyStatusPending\":\"Pending\",\"promoHistoryLeaderboardEmpty\":\"No Leaderboard data available\",\"referralAdvantageSupportDesc\":\"Get the help you need in your preferred language, all day, every day.\",\"referralCampaignCreatedToast\":\"Campaign Successfully Created\",\"referralCampaignNameMinChars\":\"At least 3 characters required\",\"referralCommissionRulesIntro\":\"Our default commission rate is 10% — calculate specific rates for each product using the formulas below.\",\"referralCreateCampaignFailed\":\"Could not create campaign\",\"referralFilterByCampaignHint\":\"Filter by Campaign Name or Campaign ID\",\"referralFilterOnlyCryptoDesc\":\"Display all crypto currency commissions.\",\"referralLargeFollowingBefore\":\"Have a large following and exceptional reach online? You could earn higher commissions through a customised program. To see if you're eligible, please\",\"referralSelectExportCampaign\":\"Select Export Campaign\",\"referralSortAvailableHighLow\":\"Available Commission: High to Low\",\"referralSortAvailableLowHigh\":\"Available Commission: Low to High\",\"referralSortWithdrawnHighLow\":\"Withdrawn Commission: High to Low\",\"referralSortWithdrawnLowHigh\":\"Withdrawn Commission: Low to High\",\"referralTooltipReferredUsers\":\"Total number of users who signed up through your referral links\",\"registerPasswordSpecialError\":\"Password must contain at least 1 special character.\",\"securityTwoFactorEnabledDesc\":\"Protect your account from unauthorized access using 2FA Authenticator.\",\"sponsor_andrew_list_3_item_1\":\"Odds elevated. Experience Tate’s exclusive kickboxing challenge and unlock bigger wins—only on Spartans.\",\"sponsor_andrew_list_3_item_2\":\"Step into the Exclusive Alpha Club: live-streaming sessions with Andrew Tate and his inner circle.\",\"sponsor_andrew_list_3_ite