-the-scenes access - get closer to the action than ever before. The X7Dave era starts now. The game changes today. History in motion.\",\"targetedWelcomeDontShowAgain\":\"Don't show this message again\",\"toastError_BonusCancelFailed\":\"Failed to cancel bonus. Please try again.\",\"toastError_FailActivateBonus\":\"Failed to activate bonus. Please try again.\",\"toastError_FailActivatePromo\":\"Failed to activate promo code. Please try again.\",\"toastSuccess_PasswordChanged\":\"Password changed successfully\",\"toastSuccess_RemovedFavorite\":\"Removed from favorites successfully\",\"toastSuccess_WithdrawRequest\":\"Withdrawal request submitted successfully\",\"weHaveAuditedOurPlatformText\":\"We have audited our platform through the world’s leading blockchain auditing firms to ensure security,transparency, and reliability. Player safety is our top priority - and we’ve got the proof to back it up.\",\"InsufficentBalanceDescription\":\"Your balance is too low to place this bet. You can add more funds to your account or simply adjust your bet amount.\",\"argentinaNationalFootballTeam\":\"Argentina National Football Team\",\"bonusBuyPartialFailureMessage\":\"Some of your bonus buys couldn’t be processed. The following items failed and will need to be retried later:\",\"cashRakeReachedModalTitleMsg1\":\"YOU'VE HIT YOUR\",\"cashRakeReachedModalTitleMsg2\":\"CASHRAKE LIMIT.\",\"cashRakeWarningModalTitleMsg1\":\"YOU'VE USED 70%\",\"cashRakeWarningModalTitleMsg2\":\"OF YOUR LIMIT.\",\"emailChangeSuccessDescription\":\"Your email has been successfully changed!\",\"emailVerificationSuccessTitle\":\"Success\",\"howCashrakeYourIngameNotifier\":\"Your In-Game Notifier\",\"lilbaby_enhancedFanEngagement\":\"Fan Engagement\",\"notificationsMessagesNoRecent\":\"No recent notifications.\",\"outrightsMessagesNoSelections\":\"No Selections Available\",\"referralAdvantageLifetimeDesc\":\"If the players you refer keep playing, you keep getting paid — forever.\",\"referralAdvantageSupport