webp"/></div><div class=""><a class="flex h-[40px] cursor-pointer items-center rounded-[10px] border px-4 font-poppins font-bold uppercase transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 bg-dark-600  text-white border-dark-600 text-xs absolute bottom-2 right-2" href="/favicon.ico/era-istrefi">detail</a></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl"><div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-[375/240] w-full"><div class="animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-[var(--sk-base)] absolute inset-0 z-[1] h-full w-full rounded-none" aria-hidden="true"></div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="375" height="240" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300" style="color:transparent" src="/images/home/partners/conor-benn.webp"/></div><div class=""><a class="flex h-[40px] cursor-pointer items-center rounded-[10px] border px-4 font-poppins font-bold uppercase transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 bg-dark-600  text-white border-dark-600 text-xs absolute bottom-2 right-2" href="/favicon.ico/conor-benn">detail</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>$RS("S:9","P:9")</script><div hidden id="S:a"><section class="style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__homeseocontent"><img alt="Logo" loading="lazy" width="200" height="35" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__logo" style="color:transparent" src="https://spartans.imgix.net/site/logo.svg?w=200&amp;h=35"/><div class="style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__content style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__collapsed"><h1 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h1"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Bet on Crypto Games at Spartans - Best Bitcoin Betting Site</strong></b></h1><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Spartans is a top-tier online gambling site with thousands of crypto games for every type of casino gamer and sports bettor. Whether you're searching for a trusted Bitcoin and crypto betting games online hub or an all-in-one Spartans crypto gaming experience, you're in the right place.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>As crypto gambling has exploded in recent years, we keep things simple, fast, and rewarding. Whether you're a casual player, crypto enthusiast, or high-stakes pro gambler, Spartans offers a wide range of crypto slots, crash games, and sports betting with your favorite tokens. Plus, we’ve built the kind of betting platform real-money players want to use. </span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h2 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h2"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">What Is Spartans?</strong></b></h2><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Spartans is a fully licensed crypto casino and sports betting site built for crypto bettors, investors, iGaming enthusiasts, bonus seekers, and every roulette roller in between. We’re redefining what a trusted Bitcoin gambling platform looks like.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Our mission is to bring secure, instant-access betting to the world’s most experienced and adventure-seeking gamblers. Our vision? A decentralized, player-first experience where fairness and freedom win.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>We support BTC, ETH, USDT, DAI, ADA, and AVAX, and that list keeps growing. From casual slot enthusiasts to strategy-minded table game players, Spartans Crypto gaming is designed to embrace all. With a vast collection of crypto gambling games, from live casino to crash and sports betting, there's always action waiting.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>We support crypto and bitcoin betting games for every type of bettor. Whether you're into classic casino tables or modern crash titles, Spartans delivers.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h2 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h2"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">How Do Spartans Bitcoin Betting Games Work? </strong></b></h2><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Crypto betting doesn’t need to be complicated. At Spartans, we make it easy to get in the game.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">1. Create Your Account </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Get started with your name, DOB, email address, phone number, address, and ID. It’s fast and keeps things compliant.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">2. Deposit Crypto </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Choose your coin. Make your first deposit with BTC, ETH, USDT, DAI, ADA, and AVAX. Balance updates once confirmed.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">3. Play &amp; Win Instantly </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Jump into Spartans gambling games and pick your favorite slots, live tables, or crash games. Place a bet, spin, wager, it’s all instant. </span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h2 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h2"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Why Bet on Spartans Crypto Games? </strong></b></h2><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Spartans game is built for crypto-savvy bettors who value speed, transparency, and real rewards. </span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Here’s why you'll love it:</strong></b></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Safe &amp; Secure Crypto Betting Platform </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Spartans are the safest online betting sites with SSL encryption, blockchain-backed games, and fair odds, a fortress for every strategic punter.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold"> Fast Withdrawals in BTC, ETH, SOL &amp; More </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Cryptocurrency withdrawals land in minutes, not hours. Perfect for risk-takers who know when to cash out.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">24/7 Customer Support &amp; Global Availability </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>At Spartans, we are 24/7 available for your queries, whether it's for depositing and withdrawing or some technical problem.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Trusted by Gamblers </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Spartans Games has earned a well-earned reputation as one of the safest online betting sites for players of all types.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h2 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h2"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">What Makes Spartans Games the Best Bitcoin Gambling Site? </strong></b></h2><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Spartans Betting is built for crypto and Bitcoin gamblers who want hassle-free experiences. Varieties of games, Clean UI, a mobile-first design, payment methods, and lightning-fast withdrawals make Spartans a top crypto betting site. It's no wonder we're considered one of the best options for Bitcoin online gambling.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Fair Odds &amp; Transparent Payouts </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>We provide RTP stats and payout odds so every spin and bet is transparent.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Cross-Chain Crypto Support (BTC, ETH, LTC, SOL, ADA) </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Multi-chain deposits mean flexibility for every crypto bettor, no matter your coin.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Community Tournaments &amp; Promotions </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Compete with fellow crypto gamers in leaderboard tournaments and unlock rewards every week.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h2 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h2"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Explore Our Most Popular Bitcoin &amp; Crypto Games </strong></b></h2><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Casino Games </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>We offer a range of</span><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold"> </strong></b><a href="https://spartans.com/casino" rel="noreferrer" class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__link"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">crypto casino games</strong></b></a><span>, from blackjack, megaways, and baccarat to roulette and poker. Our selection suits every kind of casino patron. Play real-money casino games instantly with BTC.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Live Crypto Casino Games </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Experience a thrill of</span><a href="https://spartans.com/casino/category/live-casino" class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__link"><u><span class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textUnderline"> </span></u><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">live crypto casino games</strong></b></a><span>, streamed in HD with real dealers. Perfect for live dealer fans seeking immersive crypto play.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Bitcoin Slots Games </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Step into Spartans </span><a href="https://spartans.com/casino/category/new-games" class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__link"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">casino slots games</strong></b></a><span>, fast spins and huge jackpots. Perfect for spinners and slot enthusiasts chasing big wins on mobile.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Sport Betting with Crypto </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>At Spartans online betting website, you can wager on global sports from MMA and football to tennis and boxing using crypto. Perfect for strategic wagerers who love real-time odds. Spartans is the ultimate platform for </span><a href="https://spartans.com/sports" class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__link"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">crypto sports</strong></b></a><span> and casino betting.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h2 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h2"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">FAQs </strong></b></h2><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Is online crypto gambling legal at Spartans? </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>We’re fully licensed under the Government of Anjouan, Union of Comoros, operated by Nexus International Entertainment Ltd.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">What cryptocurrencies can I use to play online games at Spartans? </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Spartans games can be played using cryptocurrencies such as BTC, ETH, USDT, DAI, ADA, and AVAX. Choose your preferred currencies and play casino and sports betting games.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">How fast are Spartans crypto payouts? </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>At Spartans, most withdrawals are processed in under 15 minutes.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Is Spartans safe for BTC betting? </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Absolutely. We use SSL encryption and probably fair technology.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Is it difficult to deposit or withdraw funds at Spartans? </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Not at all. It takes just a few clicks to cash in or cash out. You just need to provide the required information and documents.</span></p><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><br /></p><h3 class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__h3"><b><strong class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__textBold">Can I play crypto betting games for free at Spartans? </strong></b></h3><p class="PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph"><span>Yes. Spartans crypto betting games offer demo versions for new and recreational players. </span></p></div><p class="style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__readmore">Read More</p><img alt="SEO Image" loading="lazy" width="429" height="413" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__image style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__desktop" style="color:transparent" src="https://spartans.imgix.net/site/images/seo/seo-desktop.webp?w=429&amp;h=413"/><img alt="SEO Image" loading="lazy" width="180" height="345" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__image style-module-scss-module__o7BttW__mobile" style="color:transparent" src="https://spartans.imgix.net/site/images/seo/seo-mobile.webp?w=180&amp;h=345"/></section></div><script>$RS("S:a","P:a")</script><div hidden id="S:b"><section class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__homeroadmap"><div class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__titles"><h2>Transparent Progress. Future-Ready Features.</h2></div><div class="swiper style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__item style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__completed" style="--statusColor:#4AE962"><div class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__qBox"><div class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__count"><div class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__counttexts"><span>0<!-- -->1</span><p class="">Done</p></div></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__content"><p class="style-module-scss-module__eACKdq__status"><img alt="Completed" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://spartans.imgix.net/site/icons/status/check.svg?w=12&amp;h=12"/>C